{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vo1G754jRq1795515703.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>小米集團第三季少賺六成八。</p><p></p><p>盈利38.7億元人民幣，較第二季亦減少五成九。經調整淨利潤48.8億元人民幣，下跌近五成七。期內，收入1,072億元人民幣，下跌半成。</p><p></p><p>手機及智能物聯網收入佔833億元人民幣，按年減少近百分之0.9。新能源車及AI等創新業務收入，下跌一成七，至238億元人民幣。相關業務經營虧損34億元人民幣，高於第二季的26億元人民幣經營虧損。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.312025+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.030605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:17.460448+00:00","content_hash":"e1f221f67fdc44860156a7ddf07154af220fb346f97ac7f75947eacc3d219bcc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.312025+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}